# The iOS project is committed: the Info.plist document types, the icon, the
# launch screen and the SPM manifest are all hand-set, and `cap add ios` would
# regenerate them as the template's defaults. Its own .gitignore keeps the
# generated parts out — the copied web assets, DerivedData, build output.

